comment = "Capability-mode NetworkCmp TCP/UDP provider"

desc = <<EOD
The base NetworkCmp provider and networkcmpctl diagnostic client, installed as
the verified
/Capabilities/System/Network.cap bundle.  It provides bounded DNS, TCP,
connected UDP, endpoint policy, socket lifecycle, and inline data movement
without delegating kernel socket descriptors to consumers.  DNS resolution
uses a separate attenuated Casper channel and cannot block other session RPCs.
EOD
